  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-030",
    "title": "城中最后一夜"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_166",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "灰袍修士带着十余名弟子进入城门，白玉令牌上浮出封天令的三方印记。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封天令落下后的第一夜，陆照临梦见一场没有尽头的雨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5245,
          "end": 5245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "梦里他只有七岁，站在北河城老槐树下。雨水从树冠落下，像无数条透明的线。陆沉舟蹲在他面前，手里握着一盏空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5247,
          "end": 5247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5249,
          "end": 5249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会照见不该照见的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5251,
          "end": 5251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它怎么走路？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5253,
          "end": 5253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯不走路，拿灯的人走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5255,
          "end": 5255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手去摸灯柄，掌心传来灼热。梦境随即变暗，树后的屋门被人推开，沈砚秋提着青色灯火走出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5257,
          "end": 5257
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟，时间到了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5259,
          "end": 5259
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回头：“他还太小。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5261,
          "end": 5261
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉不会等他长大。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5263,
          "end": 5263
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就把我留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5265,
          "end": 5265
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经留下了一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5267,
          "end": 5267
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬起灯。灯火照在年幼的陆照临胸口，那里浮出一道半枚残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5269,
          "end": 5269
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临惊醒时，掌心冷得像雪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5271,
          "end": 5271
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离坐在火堆旁，手里捧着第二盏灯的残罩。她一夜没有睡，债契黑纹已经爬到颈侧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5273,
          "end": 5273
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你梦见什么？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5275,
          "end": 5275
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲把残印放进了我体内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5277,
          "end": 5277
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你以前不知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5279,
          "end": 5279
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得他教我修灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5281,
          "end": 5281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从洞口回来：“回川城的记忆开始混乱。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5283,
          "end": 5283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“提前了两天。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5285,
          "end": 5285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见城心了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5311,
          "end": 5311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看见了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5313,
          "end": 5313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向城中最高的钟楼。钟楼上悬着三盏灯，第一盏和第二盏已经点亮，第三盏仍然熄灭。每当钟声响起一次，城里便有一批人忘记自己的住处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5315,
          "end": 5315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“必须熄灭前两盏？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5317,
          "end": 5317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能。它们是封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5319,
          "end": 5319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就点第三盏。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5321,
          "end": 5321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点亮第三盏，城门会完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5323,
          "end": 5323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向钟楼：“封天令说三日后开门，为什么现在已经有两盏亮了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5325,
          "end": 5325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“因为持印者的记忆正在替它倒计时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5327,
          "end": 5327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摸向胸口。半枚残印的青光沿经脉流动，气海里的金色裂纹比昨日更明显。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5329,
          "end": 5329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我忘了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5331,
          "end": 5331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你自己知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5333,
          "end": 5333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临试着回忆七岁那场雨。槐树、空灯、沈砚秋，他都记得。唯独陆沉舟最后说了什么，始终想不起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5335,
          "end": 5335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜针递给他：“看针尾。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5337,
          "end": 5337
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "针尾缺口朝向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5339,
          "end": 5339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有答案？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5341,
          "end": 5341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有你下一次会失去的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5343,
          "end": 5343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城内忽然传来哭喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5345,
          "end": 5345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个年轻妇人抱着孩子冲出巷口：“谁把我女儿带走了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5347,
          "end": 5347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子就在她怀里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5349,
          "end": 5349
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人低头看了孩子一眼，惊恐地把她推开。孩子摔在地上，哭着喊娘。妇人却后退：“她不是我的孩子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5351,
          "end": 5351
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临上前扶起孩子。孩子抓住他的袖口：“叔叔，你认识我娘吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5353,
          "end": 5353
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他张口想回答，却突然忘记了“母亲”这个词的含义。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5355,
          "end": 5355
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "胸口残印骤然发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5357,
          "end": 5357
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一把将孩子抱走：“别看她的眼睛。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5359,
          "end": 5359
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相铜镜。镜中显示出另一幅画面：妇人抱着孩子走进城心，将孩子的名字交给第一盏灯；灯火熄灭后，她便忘记自己曾经有过孩子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5361,
          "end": 5361
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是未来，还是已经发生？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5363,
          "end": 5363
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5365,
          "end": 5365
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向钟楼：“有人在提前执行封天令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5367,
          "end": 5367
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟声再次响起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5369,
          "end": 5369
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中一半的人同时停下动作。他们看向彼此，像第一次见面。有人拔刀，有人跪地，也有人开始往城门外逃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5371,
          "end": 5371
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯在钟楼顶端闪烁了一瞬。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5373,
          "end": 5373
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它要点亮了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5375,
          "end": 5375
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "童年最后一段记忆终于回来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5385,
          "end": 5385
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人替你做了选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5487,
          "end": 5487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人抬头看钟楼：“那你们为什么不把名字还回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5489,
          "end": 5489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“因为还不回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5491,
          "end": 5491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无相铜镜贴在钟楼石栏上。镜面浮出一条条名字，有的完整，有的只剩姓氏。最下方出现一个熟悉的名字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5493,
          "end": 5493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在城心。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5495,
          "end": 5495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5497,
          "end": 5497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5499,
          "end": 5499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可它一直在照他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5501,
          "end": 5501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你一直在记他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5503,
          "end": 5503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的火焰忽然向外爆开，城中一半房屋的门同时打开。失名的人走出屋子，朝钟楼缓慢聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5505,
          "end": 5505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在东门大喊：“玄霄宗开始攻城！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5507,
          "end": 5507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "剑光穿过夜色，落在城墙上。灰袍修士带着十余名弟子进入城门，白玉令牌上浮出封天令的三方印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5509,
          "end": 5509
        }
      }
    ],
